				<div class="tstats"><div class="tsr"><span>HP</span><span class="tsv">+60</span></div><div class="tsr"><span>Mana</span><span class="tsv">+90</span></div><div class="tsr"><span>WIS</span><span class="tsv">+8</span></div></div><div class="tres"><div class="rp fire"><div class="rpf" style="width: 90%;"></div></div></div><div class="tlore">A faint crackle when worn.</div><div class="tprice"><span class="coin pp"></span><span>150 pp</span></div></div></div><div class="tipwrap tw-below"><div class="islot r-uncommon"><div class="spr s6"></div></div>
				<div class="ttip t-below"><div class="tarr"></div><div class="tth"><div class="tico r-uncommon"><div class="spr s6"></div></div><div><div class="ttn c-uncommon">Traveler's Boots</div><div class="tts">Feet · Leather</div></div></div>
